Cell id="n193" value="moderates" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;fontSize=10;startArrow=ERmandOne;endArrow=ERzeroToMany;startFill=0;endFill=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n2" target="n104"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n194" value="has" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;fontSize=10;startArrow=ERmandOne;endArrow=ERzeroToMany;startFill=0;endFill=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n104" target="n123"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n195" value="&lt;b&gt;Key Relationships&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. A user teaches many courses.&lt;br&gt;2. A course has many assignments.&lt;br&gt;3. A student enrols in many courses (many-to-many via enrollments).&lt;br&gt;4. An assignment receives many submissions.&lt;br&gt;5. A submission has one mark record (optional).&lt;br&gt;6. A mark is moderated and can have many audit logs.&lt;br&gt;7. An assignment can have many extensions (one per student)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="780" width="340" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n196" value="&lt;b&gt;Normalisation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The database is normalised to at least Third Normal Form (3NF):&lt;br&gt;- 1NF: all attributes are atomic and each table has a primary key.&lt;br&gt;- 2NF: non-key attributes depend on the whole key.&lt;br&gt;- 3NF: no transitive dependencies; related data is stored in separate tables." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="780" width="360" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n197" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PK = Primary Key, FK = Foreign Key, UQ = Unique Constraint&lt;br&gt;Crow's foot: one-to-many / zero-or-one" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1140" y="780" width="320" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>